213
00:08:22,549 --> 00:08:23,461
Drug agents.

214
00:08:23,836 --> 00:08:24,982
Then Lashkar.

215
00:08:25,388 --> 00:08:26,234
Now al-Qaeda.

216
00:08:26,651 --> 00:08:28,604
Headley never had one loyalty.

217
00:08:29,047 --> 00:08:31,442
He had a skill set, a passport that opened

218
00:08:31,455 --> 00:08:32,705
doors — and buyers.

219
00:08:34,124 --> 00:08:35,895
Which brings us back to O'Hare.

220
00:08:36,325 --> 00:08:38,278
When FBI agents stopped him in

221
00:08:38,291 --> 00:08:41,129
October 2009, Headley did what he had

222
00:08:41,142 --> 00:08:41,911
always done.

223
00:08:43,191 --> 00:08:44,103
He made a deal.

224
00:08:45,776 --> 00:08:48,550
In March 2010 he pleaded guilty to all

225
00:08:48,563 --> 00:08:50,802
