230
00:08:58,624 --> 00:09:01,072
Then he took the stand against his oldest

231
00:09:01,085 --> 00:09:02,817
friend, Tahawwur Rana.

232
00:09:03,991 --> 00:09:05,775
In January 2013,

233
00:09:06,257 --> 00:09:08,718
Judge Harry Leinenweber sentenced him to

234
00:09:08,731 --> 00:09:09,798
thirty-five years.

235
00:09:10,293 --> 00:09:10,515
"Mr.

236
00:09:10,593 --> 00:09:13,327
Headley is a terrorist," the judge said.

237
00:09:13,757 --> 00:09:16,231
Prosecutors had argued that life in prison

238
00:09:16,244 --> 00:09:18,548
would have been right — but for the value

239
00:09:18,561 --> 00:09:19,707
of his cooperation.

240
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:23,050
Twenty-five years after Frankfurt, the

241
00:09:23,063 --> 00:09:24,327
bargain still worked.

242
00:09:25,724 --> 00:09:27,938
