243
00:09:28,313 --> 00:09:29,706
It got him on a screen.

244
00:09:30,125 --> 00:09:32,860
In December 2015 he appeared by video

245
00:09:32,873 --> 00:09:35,294
link, from an undisclosed location in

246
00:09:35,307 --> 00:09:38,107
America, before a special court in Mumbai.

247
00:09:38,537 --> 00:09:40,946
He offered testimony in exchange for a

248
00:09:40,959 --> 00:09:41,492
pardon.

249
00:09:41,883 --> 00:09:43,120
The court accepted.

250
00:09:44,469 --> 00:09:46,982
He became an approver — a witness for the

251
00:09:46,995 --> 00:09:47,894
