252
00:09:48,284 --> 00:09:50,693
The pardon changes nothing about his US

253
00:09:50,706 --> 00:09:51,370
sentence.

254
00:09:52,544 --> 00:09:56,008
In February and March 2016, he became

255
00:09:56,021 --> 00:09:58,000
the first foreign terrorist reported to

256
00:09:58,013 --> 00:10:00,031
