257
00:10:00,422 --> 00:10:02,870
He named Pakistani intelligence officers

258
00:10:02,883 --> 00:10:04,875
he said worked alongside Lashkar's

259
00:10:04,888 --> 00:10:05,539
handlers.

260
00:10:05,956 --> 00:10:08,625
He described the ISI as backing several

261
00:10:08,638 --> 00:10:09,575
