262
00:10:10,005 --> 00:10:12,154
He also made a hearsay claim about

263
00:10:12,154 --> 00:10:13,052
Ishrat Jahan,

264
00:10:13,664 --> 00:10:16,320
a young woman killed in a 2004 police

265
00:10:16,333 --> 00:10:16,945
encounter.

266
00:10:18,191 --> 00:10:20,144
It became a political storm.

267
00:10:21,319 --> 00:10:22,478
Here is the catch.

268
00:10:22,895 --> 00:10:24,887
Every one of those claims rests on the

269
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:27,673
word of a man who trafficked, informed and

270
00:10:27,686 --> 00:10:28,689
