271
00:10:29,956 --> 00:10:31,857
His testimony is evidence.

272
00:10:32,233 --> 00:10:33,795
It is also his account.

273
00:10:35,191 --> 00:10:37,691
David Headley is serving thirty-five years

274
00:10:37,717 --> 00:10:39,709
in an undisclosed US prison.

275
00:10:40,126 --> 00:10:42,912
In 2018 there were reports that fellow

276
00:10:42,926 --> 00:10:44,176
