it reportedly asked once more.

281
00:10:55,202 --> 00:10:56,739
He has stayed in America.

282
00:10:57,894 --> 00:11:00,316
The lesson of his story isn't that one man

283
00:11:00,329 --> 00:11:01,371
fooled everyone.

284
00:11:01,761 --> 00:11:03,142
The warnings were real.

285
00:11:03,545 --> 00:11:05,863
They came from the people closest to him.

286
00:11:06,306 --> 00:11:08,415
But the agencies built to catch a man like

287
00:11:08,428 --> 00:11:10,563
him were each watching one thing — drugs,

288
00:11:10,589 --> 00:11:11,879
or spies, or terror.

289
00:11:13,116 --> 00:11:14,757
Never all three at once.

290
00:11:15,943 --> 00:11:17,675
He was the seam between them.

291
00:11:18,951 --> 00:11:21,269
And a seam is exactly where things come

292
00:11:21,282 --> 00:11:21,855
apart.
